      "body": "{ u32 a = (u32)buf;\n  int rc = pcm_write_check();\n  if (rc != 0) return rc;\n  if (buf == 0) return OS32_ERR_INVAL;\n  if (a + bytes < a) return OS32_ERR_INVAL;\n  if (!ring3_user_range_ok(a, bytes)) return OS32_ERR_INVAL;\n  if (bytes < PCM_FRAME_BYTES) return 0;\n  return pcm_write(buf, bytes); }"
